# Safety

- Never commit or paste API keys, tokens, passwords, or customer-identifying data in code, logs, commits, or PR descriptions.
- No live payment flows or production account actions from the agent environment.
- No git tags, npm publishes, marketplace submits, deploys, or workflow dispatches unless a human owner explicitly requests it outside the agent guardrails.
- Treat this repository as **public**; exclude internal business details beyond what is already in public README/marketing copy.
